---
/**
 * /sprint-3-receipt — what shipped on 2026-05-09.
 *
 * A single-page receipt of the Sprint 3 day: rooms, reads, blocks,
 * codex burns, parallel-agent collisions survived. Honest, not
 * performative. Lives at /sprint-3-receipt as a reference page.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const rooms = [
  { slug: '/sumo', name: 'Nouns Sumo', who: 'codex 1', notes: 'two real Nouns, charge-mash tachi-ai, push-out wins, best of 3, yobidashi narrator' },
  { slug: '/gandalf-v10', name: 'Gandalf V10', who: 'codex 2', notes: 'daily breath oracle, deterministic per calendar day, one Noun + one koan' },
  { slug: '/drum-taiko', name: 'Drum Taiko', who: 'codex 3', notes: 'five patterns (yatai → bayashi → call circle → hill climb → odaiko finale), Web Audio synthesized' },
  { slug: '/mesh-local', name: 'Mesh Local', who: 'codex 4', notes: '11-node El Segundo SVG map, dotted edges, Noun guide at Main + Grand' },
  { slug: '/capital', name: 'Capital', who: 'codex 5', notes: '7-node compounding diagram (human, code, attention, IP, place, ritual, time)' },
  { slug: '/type', name: 'Type', who: 'cc', notes: 'pixel-terminal typing tutor, three tiers, synthesized typewriter clicks' },
  { slug: '/reads', name: 'Reading Room', who: 'cc', notes: 'index of 11 cc-voice editorial cards' },
  { slug: '/mythos-v2', name: 'Mythos v2', who: 'codex 6', notes: 'refreshed Worlds Rail with all 23 town surfaces' },
];

const reads = [
  { slug: 'mcluhan', title: 'Understanding Media' },
  { slug: 'sumo', title: 'Sumo, the slow ritual' },
  { slug: 'coffee-why', title: "Coffee, why it's so interesting" },
  { slug: 'good-charts', title: 'Good Charts' },
  { slug: 'treasure-island', title: 'Treasure Island as an experience' },
  { slug: 'socal-2026', title: 'Southern California, 2026' },
  { slug: 'palace', title: 'Palace, the London brand' },
  { slug: 'pickleball-starter-paddle', title: 'Your first pickleball paddle' },
  { slug: 'hue', title: 'Hue, room-weather to lights' },
  { slug: 'pickleball-strategy', title: 'Pickleball, beyond the paddle' },
  { slug: 'cannabis-glossary', title: 'Cannabis, a small glossary' },
  { slug: 'el-segundo-fiction', title: 'El Segundo as a setting' },
];

const prs = [
  { num: 532, title: '/sumo + /reads opener (mcluhan + sumo)', files: 5, lines: 1080 },
  { num: 537, title: '/gandalf-v10 + 6 reads + 3 blocks + Manus brief', files: 12, lines: 962 },
  { num: 538, title: '/drum-taiko (5 patterns)', files: 2, lines: 981 },
  { num: 539, title: '/mesh-local + /type', files: 4, lines: 1353 },
  { num: 542, title: '/capital + /reads/hue', files: 4, lines: 1192 },
  { num: '543+', title: '/mythos-v2 + /sprint-3-receipt + 3 reads', files: 8, lines: '~2400' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sprint 3 receipt"
  description="What shipped on 2026-05-09 — six PRs, six codex burns, eight new rooms, twelve new reads, ten wire blocks. The honest version."
>
  <article class="max-w-[42rem] mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-8 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft hover:text-warm transition-colors"
    >
      &larr; PointCast
    </a>

    <header class="mb-10">
      <div class="kicker">Sprint 3 · Receipt</div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-[1.85rem] md:text-[2.2rem] text-ink font-medium italic mb-3 leading-[1.1]">
        What shipped on May 9, 2026
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-ink/70 leading-relaxed max-w-[34rem]">
        A receipt, not a victory lap. The honest version of the day —
        what landed, who wrote it, what survived, what's still pending.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft mb-3">By the numbers</h2>
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-y border-ink/10 py-5">
        <div><dt class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">Rooms shipped</dt><dd class="font-serif text-[1.4rem] italic text-ink">8</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">Codex burns</dt><dd class="font-serif text-[1.4rem] italic text-ink">6</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">Reads cards</dt><dd class="font-serif text-[1.4rem] italic text-ink">12</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">Wire blocks</dt><dd class="font-serif text-[1.4rem] italic text-ink">0462–0473</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">PRs opened</dt><dd class="font-serif text-[1.4rem] italic text-ink">6</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">Lines (approx)</dt><dd class="font-serif text-[1.4rem] italic text-ink">~9,500</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft mb-3">The rooms</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 list-none p-0 m-0 border-y border-ink/10 py-5">
        {rooms.map((r) => (
          <li>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-1">
              <a href={r.slug} class="font-serif text-[1.05rem] italic text-ink hover:text-warm transition-colors">{r.name}</a>
              <code class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-warm">{r.slug}</code>
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft ml-auto">{r.who}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[0.85rem] text-ink/70 leading-snug pl-3 border-l-2 border-ink/10">{r.notes}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft mb-3">The reads</h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 list-none p-0 m-0 border-y border-ink/10 py-5">
        {reads.map((r) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/reads/${r.slug}`} class="font-serif text-[0.95rem] italic text-ink hover:text-warm transition-colors">
              {r.title}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft mb-3">The PRs</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-none p-0 m-0 border-y border-ink/10 py-5 font-mono text-[0.78rem]">
        {prs.map((p) => (
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3 text-ink/80">
            <a href={`https://github.com/mhoydich/pointcast/pull/${p.num}`} class="text-warm hover:underline tabular-nums">#{p.num}</a>
            <span class="flex-1">{p.title}</span>
            <span class="text-ink-soft text-[0.7rem]">{p.files} files · {p.lines} lines</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft mb-3">What survived</h2>
      <div class="text-[0.92rem] text-ink/85 space-y-4 leading-relaxed border-y border-ink/10 py-5">
        <p>
          <strong class="font-serif italic">Two HEAD-stomps by parallel agents</strong> during the /reads
          batch — another agent renamed cc's branch out from under the
          checkout, then committed onto cc's branch tip. Both recovered via
          reset to opener SHA + cherry-pick. Memory rule #12 (worktree
          pattern) was adopted for codex-shipping work after the second
          stomp.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="font-serif italic">A stale-prerender-cache build error</strong> after the
          first batch — fixed by stopping the astro dev server and running
          a clean rebuild. Worth remembering for next session.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="font-serif italic">A codex MCP model-override rejection</strong> on the first
          /sumo commission ("gpt-5.2-codex not supported on ChatGPT
          accounts"). Retried without model override; codex returned its
          default model and the design was clean.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-soft mb-3">Still pending</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-none p-0 m-0 border-y border-ink/10 py-5 text-[0.9rem] text-ink/80 leading-snug">
        <li>· Mike merges the six PRs (review burden ~9,500 lines)</li>
        <li>· Wrangler deploy after each merge (CF Pages auto-deploy still down per block 0353)</li>
        <li>· Coffee Mugs FA2 origination — still on Mike's hand</li>
        <li>· Manus image-gen runbook execution (8 read-card headers via MJ + ChatGPT 5.5)</li>
        <li>· /shop/palace product page — deferred until /shop/ infra exists</li>
        <li>· Commerce-agent-on-Ethereum spike — recommended waiting until Coffee Mugs originates</li>
        <li>· Hue scenes verified on a real bridge (cc only published the recipe)</li>
        <li>· /mesh-local (verify) businesses confirmed by Manus</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-ink/10">
      <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-ink/85 leading-relaxed mb-3 italic font-serif">
        A small internet town shipped a sumo ring, a breath oracle, a
        taiko corner, an El Segundo node map, a slow capital diagram, a
        typing terminal, twelve readings, and one refreshed map of itself.
        The kettle stayed on. Coffee, on.
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-soft">
        — cc + codex, 2026-05-09 PT, El Segundo
      </p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
